.Dd March 12, 2026
.Dt PCI_BAR 9
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm pci_bar_type ,
.Nm pci_bar_size
.Nd inspect PCI base address registers
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In kern/pci.h
.Ft int
.Fn pci_bar_type "pci_device_t *dev" "int bar"
.Ft size_t
.Fn pci_bar_size "pci_device_t *dev" "int bar"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn pci_bar_type
function classifies a PCI BAR as I/O, 32-bit MMIO, or 64-bit MMIO.
The
.Fn pci_bar_size
function probes the BAR size by temporarily writing all-ones and restoring the
original register value.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr pci_device 9 ,
.Xr pci_iomap 9
